<title>POLAND: SOCCER-POLAND AND ENGLAND DRAW 1-1 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-POLAND AND ENGLAND DRAW 1-1 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>KATOWICE, Poland 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland and England drew 1-1 (halftime 0-1) in a European under-21 soccer championship group two qualifier on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Poland - Daniel Dubicki 65</p>
<p>England - Emile Heskey 36</p>
<p>Attendance: 2,500</p>
</text>
